# Project-F runtime state (content-free, but regenerated per-session — never the seed):
#   drafts.json    = creator draft queue (fixtures/test residue)
#   acq_queue.json = acquisition pipeline draft queue (runtime)
#   reddit_state / channel_locks = warm-up + warning kill-switch state (runtime)
#   cost_meter / KILL / HALT     = cockpit runtime flags
# Uses '*' wildcard for the Persian folder name to dodge Windows unicode-normalization quirks
# (filesystem uses one NFC spelling; git pathspec matching is byte-exact and can mismatch).
# NOTE: langar/vault.json IS committed on purpose (brand content seed, zero PII).
